{"4446870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Medieval Tavern Simulator", "steam_appid": 4446870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4800550], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Medieval Tavern Simulator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Medieval Tavern Simulator is an immersive management experience where you take over a run-down medieval tavern and transform it into the liveliest gathering spot in the kingdom. Expand your business, shape the atmosphere, and create a new story every night.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Rebuild the Tavern</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Clean, repair, and expand your establishment. Replace broken furniture, unlock new rooms, and decorate the space to match your vision. Manage your resources wisely—every coin you invest fuels your growth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Manage the Kitchen and Cellar</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Prepare delicious meals, serve strong ale, and keep production running smoothly. Improve your recipes, maintain quality, and satisfy your guests. Better food and drink mean higher tips and a stronger reputation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Serve Your Guests</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every visitor has different expectations. Deliver orders quickly, calm impatient customers, and keep troublemakers under control. Time management is the key to a successful tavern.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Shape the Atmosphere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hire musicians, host special nights, and define your tavern’s identity through decoration and entertainment. As your fame spreads, wealthier and more unusual guests will arrive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Become a Legendary Tavern Keeper</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Manage your staff, secure supplies on time, and continuously improve your business. With the right decisions, a small tavern can become a kingdom-wide legend.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Medieval Tavern Simulator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Medieval Tavern Simulator is an immersive management experience where you take over a run-down medieval tavern and transform it into the liveliest gathering spot in the kingdom. Expand your business, shape the atmosphere, and create a new story every night.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Rebuild the Tavern</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Clean, repair, and expand your establishment. Replace broken furniture, unlock new rooms, and decorate the space to match your vision. Manage your resources wisely—every coin you invest fuels your growth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Manage the Kitchen and Cellar</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Prepare delicious meals, serve strong ale, and keep production running smoothly. Improve your recipes, maintain quality, and satisfy your guests. Better food and drink mean higher tips and a stronger reputation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Serve Your Guests</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every visitor has different expectations. Deliver orders quickly, calm impatient customers, and keep troublemakers under control. Time management is the key to a successful tavern.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Shape the Atmosphere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hire musicians, host special nights, and define your tavern’s identity through decoration and entertainment. As your fame spreads, wealthier and more unusual guests will arrive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Become a Legendary Tavern Keeper</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Manage your staff, secure supplies on time, and continuously improve your business. With the right decisions, a small tavern can become a kingdom-wide legend.</p>", "short_description": "Rebuild your medieval tavern from the ground up. Serve food and ale, manage staff, entertain guests, and shape the atmosphere with music and decor. Balance profit, reputation, and chaos as every night brings new stories and unexpected events.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Russian, Turkish, Ukrainian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4446870/d05b1c4f69ca13440382948d68db8d5aba1de5bd/header.jpg?t=1786877653", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4446870/9dc52e1b5440a2f19fa9585088541dc4c1fa0ef1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786877653", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4446870/9dc52e1b5440a2f19fa9585088541dc4c1fa0ef1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786877653", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 21H2 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5-4460 or AMD Ryzen 3 3100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 or AMD Radeon™ RX 560 (4 GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Windows 10 22H2 (64-bit) or better<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> ntel Core i5-8400 or AMD Ryzen 5 2600x<br><